\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  My soul, in complete faithfulness,
\par Observe Christ, your pleasure.
\par The travails of this earthly life
\par Bid you to follow Him.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This earth here in without
\par True peace and happiness,
\par Your only pow'r is Jesus Christ,
\par Therefore never leave Him.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   Cleave to Jesus' faithfulness;
\par Observe His uprightness.
\par Cast all your burden unto Him,
\par His love has no limit.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par His straightened paths exist;
\par He overcomes our woes;
\par No matter how they frighten,
\par Watch Him and be composed.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Into your chamber, go and pray
\par To remind your saviour.
\par He is all ears for your prayer;
\par His hand will redeem you;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Should mankind reject you,
\par He never will leave you;
\par He has vowed to come to your aid,
\par Therefore, rely on Him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Lift up your heart and look at Him
\par and leave this earthly home
\par The kingdom of the Almighty
\par go search with all your faith!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Take up your life and all
\par within to your Saviour;
\par He who through His death on the cross
\par Has made the atonement.
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Arise, look for heavenly things;
\par Regard as your treasure.
\par It's there that our saviour resides,
\par Where His treasures are safe
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par these earthly things and Joy
\par are all in vanity.
\par The everlasting Joy and peace
\par in Jesus solely rest.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

